<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.gascity.claude-pool-guard</string>

  <!-- ga-8hcnvb.3 — the safety net under the pool's account switch (claude-pool-account, ga-8hcnvb.1). One run a minute:

       1. DIVERGENCE: the account whose key sits in the pool's Keychain item vs the account the decision file says the pool should use.
          Still different 2 minutes later -> ONE phone alert (priority 4, forced push) naming both accounts by e-mail + 8-hex
          fingerprint, never a key. Repeated only after 6 h if nobody fixed it; nothing is sent about it once it is fixed.
       2. LIVENESS: no clean daemon run for 10 min -> one alert.

       A check that cannot tell (Keychain locked, vault down) changes nothing and, after 30 min, says it is blind.
       The guard writes none of the pool's credentials; it never prints, logs or sends a key.

       KILL SWITCH (no reload needed): touch /Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/.gc/no-pool-account (or GC_POOL_ACCOUNT=0) — the
       guard does nothing, like the daemon. See docs/claude-pool-account.md.

       ACTIVATION is deliberately a separate, human step (merged != live): copy this file to ~/Library/LaunchAgents and
       `launchctl load` it AFTER the script exists on main — and after the daemon's own plist (the guard watches that daemon).
       Python is /usr/bin/python3 like the other city daemons (3.9: the script is tested on that interpreter). -->

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/usr/bin/python3</string>
    <string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/packs/town-deltas/assets/scripts/claude-pool-guard.py</string>
    <string>run-once</string>
  </array>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq</string>

  <!-- 60 s > a normal run (a few file reads and one `security` call): the script holds a flock, so a slow run is never doubled, only the next tick skipped. -->
  <key>StartInterval</key><integer>60</integer>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><false/>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/.gc/logs/claude-pool-guard-launchd.out</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/.gc/logs/claude-pool-guard-launchd.err</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <!-- ~/.local/bin: `secret` (the vault) and `notify` (the phone). /usr/bin: `security`. -->
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin:/Users/athos/.local/bin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/athos</string>
    <!-- the Keychain account of the pool item; launchd does not always set it. -->
    <key>USER</key>
    <string>athos</string>
    <key>GC_CITY_PATH</key>
    <string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq</string>
  </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
